<p><em>I edited the greenlight a little bit</em></p>
<p><strong>Seeking Greenlight:</strong> Yes<br />
<strong>Page type:</strong> SCP Article</p>
<p>First of all sorry for my repost. I didn't get any greenlights or the amount of feedback I had hoped for. Also I'm new to the wiki so I don't know the proper channels.</p>
<p>The SCP is already written by me and is currently residing in my sandbox until I get enough greenlights to get the SCP reviewed.</p>
<p><strong>Elevator pitch:</strong><br />
SCP-XXXX is a hydraulic press which from a first glance doesn’t seem that weird. It seems like just the ordinary hydraulic press located in different factories across the world. But upon further notice, you see that it contains several patches of skin with tattoos on them. To make things even weirder you notice that the skin doesn't match a specific skin tone (it differs from white to black skin tones). You come closer to the press and you're fascinated by the different tattoos displayed on its metalic frame. But then all the sudden…….</p>
<p>The machine transforms into a metalic cat like being with several blades coming from its body. The being moves closer at a fast speed and then all of the sudden one of its blades rips the tattooed flesh from your body with surgeon like skills. As you bleed your vision becomes blur. It gets blurrier and blurrier and just before you pass out, you see the being transform back into the hydraulic press. You see it pulvarize the flesh it took and then all the sudden your tattoo seems to appear on its metalic frame. Suddenly everything is dark and you're no more. But a part of you is now part of SCP-XXXX.</p>
<p><strong>Central narrative:</strong><br />
A part of the SCP file is dedicated to the retrieval of SCP-XXXX. One of the researchers of SCP-XXXX interviews Agent Ford who helped to retrieve the SCP. During this interview we learn about the circumstances in which SCP-XXXX has been found and contained.<br />
Example:<br />
In 1988 several people went missing from a small town named Lockhart in Texas. A anonymous phone call from a women got the police to believe that the missing people were held at the Johnson &amp; son factory in town. After some searching the officers and a foundation agent named Ford found a pile of dead bodies, their tattooed flesh ripped from their bodies. And next to it SCP-XXXX (the tattooed hydraulic press).</p>
<p>After the retrieval of SCP-XXXX the reader gets to read about research performed on SCP-XXXX. The reader learns about the nature of SCP-XXXX’s anomylous abilities. For example: SCP-XXXX has two modes of existence. It has its hydraulic press body which have several tattooed flesh patches on its frame, and it also has a secondary body, which is a cat like being into which the tattooed press transforms.</p>
<p>The research leads to several incidents and eventually to adjustments to the special containment procedures performed. While research is also starting to search for a way to use SCP-XXXX for the retrieval of other SCP's.</p>

							</div>

								
					
